    "body": "This would look a bit nicer:\r\n```rust\r\n            .enumerate()\r\n            .filter_map(|(i, ec)| {\r\n                format_exit_code(\r\n                    ec.as_str(),\r\n                    if i == pipestatus.len() - 1 {\r\n                        segment_format\r\n                    } else {\r\n                        &segment_format_with_separator\r\n                    },\r\n                    None,\r\n                    &config,\r\n                    context,\r\n                )\r\n                .ok()\r\n                .map(|segments| segments.into_iter().map(|s| s.to_string()))\r\n            })\r\n            .flatten()\r\n            .collect::<String>(),\r\n```",
